## 获取迭代基本信息

通过迭代 ID 获取迭代基本信息

| method | GET |
|-|-|
| url | /v1.0/work/iterations/{iterationId}/detail |
| buc login | true |

### Path parameters

| 参数名称 | 参数类型 | 必传 | 默认值 | 参数描述 |
|-|-|-|-|-|
| iterationId | Number | true | - | 迭代 ID |

### Returns

| 参数名称 | 参数描述 |
|-|-|
| app | 应用基础信息，对象信息查看 [App](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls4gore2dimt38o1v5g) |
| appconf | 应用配置信息，对象结构为：{...[AppConf](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls76zlqwgy4ezf22wtp), app_pub_conf: [AppPubConf](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls79nsulkskk7dmxf7)} |
| usermember | 发起人成员角色 |
| iteration | 迭代详情信息，对象结构为：{...[Iteration](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls6xiuwp43jozm69u9h), user: [User](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls369lxfelxab4mn50j),  lastTask: [Task](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls8dfb66h0t67j0phai), devbranches: [Change](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls8c5351a5qllc8tzaq)[] } |
| iterationconf | 迭代配置信息，对象信息查看 [IterationConf](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls8c3kve3swm6gi6twn) |

